OL,3,GNEWSAFraud enquiry into regeneration
OL,4,Aproject dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed no action will be
OL,7,Ftaken after a year-long probe into a
OL,8,Fmajor government-backed project.
OL,10,FThe Life Factory project in Glastonbury
OL,11,Fwas meant to transform a derelict
OL,12,Fformer factory block into a community
OL,13,Fevents space as part of the #23.6m Town
OL,14,FDeal scheme.
OL,16,FBut Somerset Council froze funds to the
OL,17,Fproject in 2024 after serious concerns
OL,18,Fwere raised about its management,
OL,19,Ffollowed in 2025 by a critical audit
OL,20,Freport, the details of which were
OL,21,Fshared with Avon and Somerset
OL,22,FConstabulary's fraud team.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
