OL,3,GNEWSAFraud enquiry into regeneration
OL,4,Aproject dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter reviewing the project, the force
OL,7,Fsaid it found there was "insufficient
OL,8,Fevidence of criminality" to warrant
OL,9,Ffurther investigation of the council or
OL,10,Fany other party involved.
